--Description: Spot-check the 20 states with the largest single-day jumps on
--             31-Mar-2020.  The date window remains Mar-01–May-31 (all states
--             have observations inside that period, even if some—e.g. Alabama—
--             start after Mar-01).  No change needed beyond the explanatory
--             comment.
